    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>integer sequences for whether they are consecutive.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>SKM </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>10/12/2016</para>
</simplesect>
<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Finds the max­i­mum and min­i­mum ele­ments in sequences</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Checks if the sequence length = max-min+1</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Checks if the sequence contains duplicates</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>checks whether the elements of the sequence are consecutuve</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>current implementation is restricted to size_t unsigned integers.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>use <ref refid="class_consecutive_sequence_checker_1ae279a6852c64c467cdef67fb26e945ef" kindref="member">Test_ConsecutiveSequenceChecker()</ref> to see verification of methods. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
